do5KXU7BNLExx3xW-vSMdVCDtD9Kn8fIIz8zDIpzd2nfKWPwfXj5VTZkUnhIkMp6bI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3lzwNFKLvMs5A-uZNWB6vBE0fIMj5arqxwPPp9Aruuvg&oe=69F8C1CB"}, "display_name": "GuruLok: A Spiritual Multiverse", "keywords": ["meditation", "temple", "india", "spiritual", "kirtan"], "long_description": "Experience spirituality like never before in \"GuruLok: A Spiritual Multiverse.\" This Early Access application invites you to step inside a meticulously 3D-scanned Indian Temple, brought to life with photorealistic detail and immersive audio.\n**Key Features in Update 1.2:**\n*   **Interactive Satsang (NEW):** Meet Guru Anisha and Suresh, a digital spiritual guide. Use your voice to ask questions and receive wisdom in a face-to-face virtual setting. (Requires Microphone permissions).\n*   **Immersive Kirtan:** Experience a 3D spatialized musical meditation session.\n*   **Virtual Darshan:** Walk freely through sacred temple courtyards and ancient architecture.\n*   **Snap-Turn Locomotion:** Designed for comfort in both standing and room-scale modes.\nJoin us in this growing multiverse of peace and mindfulness.", "short_description": "Step into a photorealistic ancient Indian temple for a spiritual journey. Experience immersive 3D Kirtan, explore the sacred grounds, and engage in an interactive voice-guided Satsang with a virtual Guru."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.trigunai.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TrigunAI Innovations Pvt Ltd", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.trigunai.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT",