, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 11}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "32526571810261290", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "35612832118301895"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1142403860893479"}]}, "change_log": "Build 673: New Anisha speaking animation (replacement) + first production-mode validation build. (Re-upload of build 672 contents - 672 upload failed due to choppy internet, no code/asset changes between them.) (1) Replaced Anisha_Speaking.anim with a new authored 16.033s gesture clip - imported from new FBX with Humanoid rig + Avatar copied from GuruAnishaModel for proper bone routing on the humanoid skeleton. Old 15s clip deleted, new clip placed at the same path so Animator Controller path-based references resolve to the new GUID. Loop Time enabled. (2) Animator Controller GurujiAnishaAnimatorController_v1 SatsangSpeaking state Motion field re-bound to new clip GUID. Idle/SatsangSpeaking transitions verified intact - TriggerSatsang on Idle to SatsangSpeaking, TriggerSatsangEnd on SatsangSpeaking to Idle, both Has Exit Time off. (3) Addressables rebuilt - Anisha_Group bundle hash regenerated to include the new clip. Quest will re-download anisha_group bundle on first launch (CDN delivers ~5-15MB). (4) Dev Build flag OFF (was ON in builds 668-671) - this is a production-mode validation build. APK is no longer debuggable, IL2CPP optimizations applied, Profiler hooks stripped. APK size dropped from ~448MB to ~386MB as a result. Logcat verbose logs (DirectGuruBridge, SatsangManager step timings) will not appear in this build - if any issue surfaces, next iteration should re-enable Dev Build for diagnostic capture. (5) Behaviour validation targets - Satsang response latency 3-4s end-to-end (post Pinecone removal from build 671), no doha truncation due to max_tokens=250, Anisha plays new speaking gesture during audio with smooth Idle/SatsangSpeaking transitions, both Hindi and English personas produce authentic dohas/shlokas without fabrications.", "created_date": 1777240344, "id": "35612832118301895", "version": "1.4.1", "version_code": 673, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 11}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "32526571810261290", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "35612832118301895"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1777231721, "id": "35610720765179697", "version": "1.4.1", "version_code": 671, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 11}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "32526571810261290", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "35612832118301895"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1777142435, "id": "35587598230825284", "version": "1.4.1", "version_code": 669, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 11}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset